A NOTE ON WHAT IS AND IS NOT LICENSED HERE

This license covers the compilation, the written analysis, and the structured
data in this repository.

It does not, and cannot, cover the underlying requirements themselves. Those
are published by DoorDash, Uber Eats, Grubhub, Toast and Square, and belong to
them. Quoted wording from those platforms is reproduced here in short excerpts
for identification and commentary, with attribution and a source URL in every
case.

This repository is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by any of the
platforms it documents.
